{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17216","headline":"酬灵彻上人以诗代书见寄 · 权德舆","name":"酬灵彻上人以诗代书见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莲花出水地无尘，中有南宗了义人。\n已取贝多翻半字，还将阳焰谕三身。\n碧云飞处诗偏丽，白月圆时信本真。\n更喜开缄销热恼，西方社里旧相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}